    "task_id": "review-dispatch-packet-handle",
    "goal": "The Review envelope prompt becomes a four-line handle (marker, packet path, packet sha256, verify instruction) and the reviewer instructions move into a runtime-written `review-packet-<operation>.md` in the reservation's evidence directory, on both Hosts (Spec review-dispatch-handle S2, D5).",
    "acceptance": [
