        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v2\",\n  \"command\": {\n    \"executable\": \"bun\",\n    \"argv\": [\n      \"test\",\n      \"tests/pi-canary-native-review.test.ts\",\n      \"tests/pi-canary-review-neighborhood.test.ts\",\n      \"tests/claude-review-host-async-agent.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"cwd\": \".\",\n    \"timeout_ms\": 300000,\n    \"max_output_bytes\": 131072\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"prepare\": null,\n    \"writable_paths\": []\n  }\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC2",
        "assertion": "Releasing a reservation (stop, snapshot change, unbound submit) removes the packet with its evidence directory, and a fresh reservation writes a new packet under a new operation name; the evidence manifest bytes are unchanged by the packet.",
